==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|en|eo}} {{term|joy|lang=en}}, {{etyl|fr|eo}} {{term|joie|lang=fr}}, {{etyl|it|eo}} {{term|gioia|lang=it}}

===Verb===
{{eo-verb|ĝoj}}

# to be [[glad]], [[happy]], or [[joyful]]; to [[rejoice]]
#: Kiam la militio finis, oni strate '''ĝojis'''.
#: ''When the war ended, people rejoiced in the streets.''
#: Mi ne scias kial vi '''ĝojas.'''
#: ''I don't know why you are happy.''

====Derived terms====
* [[ĝoja]], ''glad'', ''joyful''
* [[ĝojo]], ''happiness'', ''joy''

